OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear skies developing across the
OL,7,Fregion. The blustery winds will start
OL,8,Fto ease through the evening, though
OL,9,Fstronger gusts are possible along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FGenerally fine and dry with
OL,13,Fsunny spells. Winds easing further to
OL,14,Fbecome light by the evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,17,Fwarm Sunday, with isolated showers.
OL,18,FDry on Monday, with a band of
OL,19,Fpotentially heavy rain and strong
OL,20,Fwinds moving in during the evening.
OL,21,FRain and strong winds for Tuesday.
